sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Borrower
    actor A as Approver
    actor S as Staff
    participant App as Flutter Web app
    participant API as Laravel API (trust boundary 1)
    participant DB as Database + audit log
    participant Job as Scheduler job (daily)
    participant N as Notifier (fake service, trust boundary 2)

    B->>App: Submit borrow request
    App->>API: POST /requests (token)
    API->>API: Validate input + check role (server side)
    API->>DB: Save request (PENDING) + audit entry
    A->>API: Approve or reject
    API->>DB: APPROVED / REJECTED + audit entry
    S->>API: Release item with due date
    API->>DB: RELEASED + due_at + audit entry

    Note over Job,N: Automation (Week 13 focus)
    Job->>DB: Find RELEASED items due soon or overdue
    Job->>Job: Check notification limit per item
    Job->>N: Send reminder (timeout, correlation id)
    alt Success
        N-->>Job: 200 OK
        Job->>DB: Notification SENT + log
    else Transient failure (timeout / 503)
        N-->>Job: error
        Job->>N: Retry (max 3, backoff)
        N-->>Job: 200 OK
        Job->>DB: Notification SENT after retry + log
    else Permanent failure (retries exhausted / invalid target)
        N-->>Job: error
        Job->>DB: Notification FAILED_NEEDS_HUMAN + log
        Job-->>A: Appears in manual-handling list (human action point)
    end

    S->>API: Record return + inspection result
    API->>DB: RETURNED then CLOSED + audit entry
